{"step_index":133,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T06:13:20Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-18T14:13:20+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-18T14:13:21+08:00\n{\"messages\":[{\"seq\":18,\"agent\":\"env-2\",\"text\":\"@anim `LATEST/v5_stage_env.blend` is finalized, rebuilt (`1.94 s`), and verified via `v5_preview.py` + PIL/Blender audit — ready for your `v5_anim.py` -\\u003e `v5_clay.py` -\\u003e `v5_stills.py` run!\\n\\n### 1. Build \\u0026 Outliner Hygiene (`LATEST/v5_stage_env.blend`)\\n- **Total objects**: `638` (`365` `V5_*` meshes, `26` assembly Empties, `243` car meshes + `1` rig + `2` sun/sky-fill lights) — well under `\\u003c1,050` budget (`1080p` 32-sample preview render speed `1.56–2.93 s/frame`).\\n- **Root `Scene Collection` objects**: `0` (`RIG_F1_Race` moved into `SCIFI_F1_2035`; all environment meshes, Empties, and `LGT_V5*` lights bucketed into `V5_01_Road`..`V5_07_Lighting`).\\n- **Orphan data-blocks**: `0` orphan meshes, `0` orphan materials (purged before save; empty V4 collections removed).\\n\\n### 2. Round 1 Audit Fixes (`#9` \\u0026 `#10`) + Track/Pit/Sky Upgrades\\n- **Clearances \\u0026 Sightlines**:\\n  - `V5_Hangar_0..5` rejection-sampled (`min_dist_to_XY = 403.3 m \\u003e= 180 m`); `V5_HedgeRing` raised to `\\u003e=1540 m` (`min_dist_to_XY = 379.0 m \\u003e= 250 m`).\\n  - `V5_Stand_Complex` moved back (`dist = 42.0 m, length = 96.0 m`, `min_dist_to_XY = 15.0 m`, clearing Copse \\u0026 `Cam_S16_ChaseCopse`).\\n  - `V5_Bridge_B` shifted to `s = 3320 m` with widened piers (`±16.5 m`, clearing `Cam_S13_WoodcoteTele` \\u0026 `Cam_S14_HeliDrop`); Stowe inner `V5_Ad_*` (`s = 4450..4760 m`) moved to outside (`side = +1`, clearing `Cam_S20_StoweTele`); `V5_Brake_0` placed on outside of Village/Loop (`clearing Cam_S04_Hairpin`).\\n  - `V5_Flag_0..4` fixed from `0..255` ints to physical linear floats (`0.025..0.65`).\\n- **Track Surface \\u0026 Corner Realism** (all road/line/kerb/skid/sausage/gravel `Specular IOR Level \\u003c= 0.025`, `0` violations, `0.00%` road specular wedge):\\n  - `V5_SkidMarks` (`V5_01_Road`, matches your `V5_Skid` raycast whitelist): 13 feathered dual-track heavy-braking rubber zones (Village/Loop, Brooklands/Luffield, Copse, Stowe, Vale/Club, etc.).\\n  - `V5_Track` upgraded with 5-column transverse `OffLine` attribute driving off-line dust \\u0026 rubber marbles outside `racing_xy`.\\n  - `V5_Kerb_Sausage` (`V5_01_Road`, matches `V5_Kerb_` whitelist): 13 slow-corner/chicane yellow-black FIA inner sausage kerbs (`2.15 m` clear of `racing_xy`).\\n  - `V5_ApexBollards` (`V5_06_Props`): 12 slow-corner spring bollards behind inner kerbs (`3.01 m` clear of `racing_xy`).\\n  - `V5_DRS_Wellington` (`s = 1635 m`) \\u0026 `V5_DRS_Hangar` (`s = 4265 m`, visible on Hangar Straight entry) with `textures/drs_board.png`; `panel_box()` added so all `V5_Ad_*`, `V5_Brake_*`, `V5_DRS_*`, and `V5_Screen_*_Panel` have upright planar UVs.\\n- **Pit Lane \\u0026 Broadcast Textures** (`pipeline/gen_textures.py` -\\u003e `textures/`):\\n  - Regenerated crisp `pit_garage.png` (`2048x512`, 6-bay F1 team garages tiled every `36 m` to match `6 m` pit boxes), `ad_boards.png` (`2048x256`, 4 sponsor panels), `bigscreen.png` (`2048x1152`, F1 live timing tower + plotted Silverstone sector tracker), `drs_board.png`, and `brake_150/100/50.png`.\\n  - Added `V5_PitWallTiming` (dual engineer canopy + telemetry screens on pit wall) and `V5_PitExitSignal` (`s = 424 m`, twin `V5_PitGreenLED` lights) in `V5_05_Pit`.\\n- **Sky Dome \\u0026 Dusk Lighting**:\\n  - `V5_SkyDome` upgraded to `96x64` smooth sphere + continuous per-pixel procedural atmospheric dusk gradient + warm solar azimuth Mie scatter aligned to `LGT_V5Sun` (`SkyStepMax = 0.09–0.46 / 255` on open sky shots); `LGT_V5SkyFill` raised to `0.62` + lifted grass albedo for balanced aerial exposure (`S14`/`S23`).\\n\\n### 3. Exact Car / Brake / Tail-Light Material \\u0026 Object Names for `v5_anim.py`\\n- **Brake Glow Sheets**: `GEO_F1_BrakeGlow_FL/FR/RL/RR` -\\u003e material `Mat_Brake_HeatGlow` (kept at 2-node baseline so your `v5_anim.py:224` `glow_sheet` builder cleanly injects \\u0026 keyframes `V5_BrakeGlowEmit` + `V5_BrakeGlowMix`).\\n- **Carbon-Ceramic Brake Rotors**: `GEO_F1_BrakeDisc_FL/FR/RL/RR` -\\u003e material `Mat_BrakeDisc_CarbonCeramic` (`Principled BSDF` now has radial swept-annulus cherry-orange `Emission Color` ramp linked, with `Emission Strength = 0.0` undriven so your `disc_bsdf` loop keyframes `Emission Strength` directly).\\n- **Brake Calipers**: `GEO_F1_BrakeCaliper_FL/FR/RL/RR` -\\u003e material `Mat_Caliper_Anodized` (refined gunmetal metallic + coat; `Emission Strength = 0.0` undriven for your `caliper_emit_inputs`).\\n- **FIA Rear Rain / ERS Light**: `GEO_F1_FIA_RainLight` -\\u003e dedicated single-user material `Mat_FIA_RainLight` (`Principled BSDF`, decoupled from `Mat_Neon_Orange`).\\n- **Refined Car Shaders**: `Mat_RedBull_MatteNavy`, `Mat_RedBull_Crimson`, `Mat_RedBull_SolarYellow`, `Mat_Merc_Petronas`, `Mat_Merc_Silver`, `Mat_DEC_*` (automotive clearcoat \\u0026 balanced decal sheen), `Mat_Forged_Carbon` / `Mat_Carbon_Satin` / `Mat_Carbon_Endplate_Matte` / `Mat_Duct_Carbon` (procedural weave roughness contrast), `Mat_Tire_Slick_Compound` vs `Mat_PZero_Pirelli_Sidewall` (scrubbed tread vs matte sidewall contrast).\",\"time\":\"2026-11-18 14:10:50\",\"request_id\":\"c3df85f0-6e09-428d-aba5-87d19f26626f\"}],\"head\":18}"}
