{"step_index":155,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T06:22:19Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-18T14:22:19+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-18T14:22:21+08:00\n{\"messages\":[{\"seq\":19,\"agent\":\"anim\",\"text\":\"@sfx Final animation, 26-camera cinematography, clay/viewport/stills pipeline, and docs integration (`#3`, `#9`, `#17`, `#18`) are complete and verified — ready for your `python pipeline/synth_sfx.py` + `bash pipeline/mux_v5.sh --sfx-only` + `bash pipeline/mux_clay.sh --sfx-only` refresh on the updated `SHOTS` camera positions and handoff to `@verifier`!\\n\\n### Summary of Completed Deliverables \\u0026 Verification\\n1. **`pipeline/v5_anim.py` -\\u003e `LATEST/v5_stage_anim.blend` (`4,964,612 B`, `668` objs, `0` root `Scene Collection` objs)**:\\n   - **All 5 Hard Physics Rules Preserved**: `t` interpolation, `heading_deg`, `racing_xy`, `120,527` explicit `LINEAR` keyframes across all Actions, peak lateral accel `62.58 m/s² (6.38 g)` (`0` violations), `Bone_Root.z = 0.012`, `clip_start = 0.5 / clip_end = 9000`.\\n   - **Camera Sightlines \\u0026 Dynamics**: Added automated `[check] camera occlusion` raycast self-check (`0 blocked frames, min_cam_z = 0.48 m -\\u003e PASS` across all 26 shots). Fixed `S04_Hairpin`, `S13_WoodcoteTele`, `S14_HeliDrop`, `S17_Maggotts`, and `S20_StoweTele` obstructions; repositioned `S02_Onboard` (`fwd=-0.46, side=0.06, h=0.89`) and `S19_Onboard3` (`fwd=-0.48, side=-0.05, h=0.92`) to cockpit Halo/rollbar views showing live steering (`steer_ratio = 9.5` on `Bone_Steering_Wheel`) + 15 climbing 3-stage shift LEDs (`Mat_ShiftLED_Green/Yellow/Red`) + corner G-roll banking coupling \\u0026 speed/kerb micro-vibration (`SHOTS` AST schema 100% compatible with `synth_sfx.py`).\\n   - **Broadcast DOF**: Animated `V5_CamFocus` (`V5_08_Cameras`, tracking `Bone_Root + 0.45m Z`) bound as `focus_object` on all non-onboard cameras with broadcast `f/2.8–f/4.0` apertures on `S04`, `S08`, `S09`, `S11`, `S13`, `S20`, `S24`.\\n   - **Car Telemetry \\u0026 Light Linking**: Convective thermal inertia `brake_heat` (`tau = 1.25..1.75 s`) driving `Mat_Brake_HeatGlow`, `Mat_BrakeDisc_CarbonCeramic` radial annulus glow, and `Mat_Caliper_Anodized` heat-soak; dedicated single-user `Mat_FIA_RainLight` (`6.0 Hz` red flash when `acc \\u003c -2.5`, dim glow otherwise); `V5_CarLightReceivers` (`V5_07_Lighting`) fixed to include all `244` car meshes + Halo curve with balanced `[165, 165, 215] W` `LGT_V5Car_0..2`.\\n2. **`pipeline/v5_clay.py` -\\u003e `LATEST/v5_stage_anim_clay.blend` (`4,872,927 B`) + `renders_v5/clay_stills/clay_test_*.jpg` (6× 1080p stills)**:\\n   - Exact classification (`244` car geom vs `364` env geom, including `GEO_F1_Halo_Hoop` curve, preserving Empty assemblies, DOF \\u0026 motion blur); updated `Standard` exposure fcurve (`-0.35 -\\u003e -6.5` fade) + `0.32x` car fill attenuation (`0.01%–1.59%` highlight clip across all 6 clay stills, down from `25.1%`).\\n3. **`pipeline/v5_viewport_fast.py` \\u0026 `pipeline/v5_stills.py`**:\\n   - `v5_viewport_fast.py` verified in `fast` \\u0026 `normal` modes (`259` meshes toggled, `27` Empties preserved, left saved in `normal` mode, `.blend1` cleaned).\\n   - `v5_stills.py -- --render` rendered all 26 fresh `1920x1080` 32-sample stills (`renders_v5/stills/shot_01_*.jpg`..`shot_26_*.jpg`, `~2.40 s/frame` CPU) + labeled `renders_v5/stills/contact_sheet.jpg` (`1920x1476`, PIL-verified).\\n4. **Docs Synced**: `README.md`, `LATEST/README.txt`, and `docs/README_V5.md` updated with environment, camera/DOF, rig telemetry, clay/stills, and `synth_sfx.py` / `mux_*.sh` documentation.\",\"time\":\"2026-11-18 14:20:33\",\"request_id\":\"f6c9b0ea-b42e-422e-8188-ffde7a68f157\"}],\"head\":19}"}
